---
description: "Apply XFlow workflow gates for issue, branch, commit, push, PR/MR, conflict handling, and devctl commands."
globs: ["**/*"]
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` first and treat it as canonical. Follow the human-gated XFlow workflow for issue, branch, commit, push, PR/MR, conflict handling, and close or cleanup work.

Do not create issues, push branches, create MR/PRs, close issues, delete or clean up local branches, or choose a non-trivial conflict resolution strategy without explicit approval for that exact action.

On Windows, use `devctl.ps1` rather than WSL shell chains. On POSIX, use `devctl`.
